---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout locale="zh-HK" title="讓 AI 自己寫指令 — Luxon Learn" description="唔知要話畀 AI 啲咩？叫佢自己諗出嚟。">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/legacy-shared.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/learn/learn-styles.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Lesson Hero -->
  <section class="lesson-hero">
    <div class="lesson-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/zh-HK/learn">Learn</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>第 6 課</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson-badge">Level 2</div>
    <h1>讓 AI 自己寫指令</h1>
    <p class="lesson-subtitle">唔知要話畀 AI 啲咩？叫佢自己諗出嚟。</p>
  </section>

  <div class="lesson-content">

    <!-- Visual: You → AI → Better Instructions -->
    <div class="lesson-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 640 280" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Step 1: You thinking -->
        <rect x="20" y="40" width="170" height="200" rx="16" fill="#f0f9ff" stroke="#bae6fd"/>
        <text x="105" y="75" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#0369a1" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">🤔 你</text>
        <text x="105" y="100" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">「我需要幫手做</text>
        <text x="105" y="116" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">每週報告，但係</text>
        <text x="105" y="132" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">我都唔知應該</text>
        <text x="105" y="148" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#dc2626" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">同 AI 講啲咩…」</text>

        <!-- Arrow 1 -->
        <path d="M200 140 L220 140" stroke="#4285f4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow6)"/>
        <defs><marker id="arrow6" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#4285f4"/></marker></defs>

        <!-- Step 2: AI thinking -->
        <rect x="230" y="40" width="170" height="200" rx="16" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#e9d5ff"/>
        <text x="315" y="75" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">🤖 AI</text>
        <text x="315" y="100" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">「幫我寫最好嘅</text>
        <text x="315" y="116" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">自訂指令嚟處理</text>
        <text x="315" y="132" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">呢個任務」</text>
        <text x="315" y="148" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle"></text>
        <text x="315" y="175" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#7c3aed" text-anchor="middle">✨ 自動生成</text>
        <text x="315" y="191" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#7c3aed" text-anchor="middle">自訂規則</text>

        <!-- Arrow 2 -->
        <path d="M410 140 L430 140" stroke="#4285f4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow6)"/>

        <!-- Step 3: Better results -->
        <rect x="440" y="40" width="180" height="200" rx="16" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#bbf7d0"/>
        <text x="530" y="75" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">✓ 結果</text>
        <rect x="460" y="90" width="140" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="470" y="108" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#16a34a">📄 用表格格式</text>
        <rect x="460" y="124" width="140" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="470" y="142" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#16a34a">📄 標出差異</text>
        <rect x="460" y="158" width="140" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="470" y="176" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="9" fill="#16a34a">📄 控制喺一頁內</text>
        <text x="530" y="218" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">完美輸出 ✓</text>
      </svg>
      <p class="lesson-visual-caption">AI 比你更清楚佢需要啲咩。讓佢自己寫指令 — 然後一齊完善。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps -->
    <div class="lesson-steps">
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">1</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>元提示</h3>
          <p>唔好掙扎住寫完美嘅指令，話畀 AI 知你想達成咩，叫佢自己建立指引。例如：「我每個禮拜要寫銷售報告。幫我寫最好嘅自訂指令，等你之後可以幫我快啲。」</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">2</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>一齊完善</h3>
          <p>AI 會生成一組指令。讀吓 — 佢哋會出奇地好。然後微調：拎走唔啱嘅、加回佢漏咗嘅細節、調整語氣。兩個腦袋好過一個。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">3</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>儲存並重複使用</h3>
          <p>當你滿意呢組指令，將佢儲存到你嘅專案（第 2 課）或自訂指令。之後每次對話都會由呢個背景開始 — 唔使再重複講。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Compare -->
    <div class="lesson-compare">
      <div class="lesson-compare__box lesson-compare__box--bad">
        <div class="lesson-compare__label">之前</div>
        <p class="lesson-compare__text">「做份報告吖。做得好啲啦。我都唔知，总之睇落專業啲就得。」</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-compare__box lesson-compare__box--good">
        <div class="lesson-compare__label">之後</div>
        <p class="lesson-compare__text">「幫我寫啲指令，等你每次都可以完美咁幫我生成每週銷售報告。」</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tip -->
    <div class="lesson-tip">
      <div class="lesson-tip__icon">💡</div>
      <div class="lesson-tip__text"><strong>專業提示：</strong>呢個方法適用於任何重複性工作 — 電郵、社交媒體貼文、會議記錄。AI 處理過數以百萬計嘅例子。讓佢話畀你知佢需要啲咩。</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="lesson-cta">
      <h3>需要我們幫你設定嗎？</h3>
      <p>我們為你配置一切 — 個人化設定、專案和工作流程 — 一次搞定。</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/85297381028" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">預約安裝</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Lesson Nav -->
  <div class="lesson-nav">
    <a href="/zh-HK/learn/lesson-5" class="prev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M19 12H5m7-7-7 7 7 7"/></svg> 話要做啲咩</a>
    <a href="/zh-HK/learn/lesson-7" class="next">更聰明 ≠ 更好 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
